{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wnnI5gLTCV1795704786.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>六福集團中期多賺一成半。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底止半年度，純利7.1億元。中期息每股維持55仙。期內，收入81.9億元，按年上升近兩成。</p><p></p><p>毛利率收窄10.4個百分點，至百分之24.3，主要由於金價下跌，以及按重量計價的黃金產品的，銷售佔比上升所致。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:43:59.842581+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:14.818392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:19.233158+00:00","content_hash":"83ee434675b7ba80155e1cae8f58f212b13b27531c55175c3c56a274f0d135a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:43:59.842581+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}